/div&gt;<br><br>Select modelling approaches considering interpretability, stability and operational constraints<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Collaborate with data engineering teams to ensure consistency between training and inference pipelines<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Ensure AI solutions are production -ready, explainable and scalable<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Support client workshops, discovery sessions and solution walkthroughs<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Provide technical guidance and design oversight to data scientists and ML engineers<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;<br><br>Requirements&lt;\/h3&gt;<br><br>TECHNICAL EXPERTISE<br><br>&lt;\/b&gt;<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Solid foundation in statistics, machine learning and applied data science<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Experience with supervised, unsupervised, semi -supervised and ensemble learning techniques<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Hands -on expertise in time -series modeling, forecasting and sequence -based data<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Experience with generative AI and LLM -based systems, including retrieval -augmented generation (RAG)<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Understanding of evaluation strategies, biasvariance trade -offs, feature leakage and model generalization<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Familiarity with model lifecycle management, data drift and concept drift<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>TOOLS &amp; PLATFORMS&lt;\/b&gt;<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Python and the modern data science ecosystem<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>ML frameworks such as TensorFlow, PyTorch and Scikit -learn<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>LLM and generative AI frameworks and orchestration tools<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Cloud platforms and contemporary data platforms<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Open Source and Propriety tooling<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Ability to evaluate and recommend tools and architectures based on enterprise context<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>DOMAIN KNOWLEDGE (PREFERRED)&lt;\/b&gt;<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Experience or strong familiarity with Telecom technology and data domains<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Exposure to BSS/OSS systems, roaming technology, charging, billing, customer analytics or network performance data<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Ability to incorporate domain constraints into AI solution design and evaluation<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>QUALIFICATIONS&lt;\/b&gt;<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>8+ years of experience in Data Science, AI/ML or advanced analytics roles<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Proven delivery of real -world, production -grade AI solutions<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Comfortable operating in client -facing, consultative environments<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>Strong communication skills and system -level thinking<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>ROLE CHARACTERISTICS&lt;\/b&gt;<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;<br><br>This role sits at the intersection of business understanding, deep technical expertise and delivery accountability. It is not a research -only or back -office position; it requires ownership, judgment and the ability to operate effectively across abstraction levels from data and models to systems and business outcomes.<br><br>&lt;\/div&gt;&lt;\/span&gt; .</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ_217" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCcQQw" data-ved="2ahUKEwig67LAnIyYAxUqyDgGHSuUJw8Ql5ACegQIJxBD"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria-hidden="true" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 -960 960 960"><path d="M480-344L240-584l56-56L480-456L664-640l56,56L480-344Z"></path></svg></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="XFOJCe" data-ved="