Maintain documentation of analysis, methodologies, and project results.<br><br>Eligibility Criteria<br><br>Students, freshers, and candidates interested in Data Science may apply.<br>Basic knowledge of Python programming.<br>Familiarity with Pandas, NumPy, and data visualization is preferred.<br>Basic understanding of statistics and probability.<br>Knowledge of SQL and database concepts is an advantage.<br>Familiarity with Excel, Power BI, Tableau, or Machine Learning is desirable.<br>Valuable analytical, logical reasoning, and problem-solving skills.<br>Willingness to learn recent tools and complete assigned projects.<br><br>What You Will Gain<br><br>Practical experience in data analysis and exploratory data analysis.<br>Exposure to real-world datasets and data science workflows.<br>Experience with Python, SQL, and visualization tools.<br>Prospects to develop analytical and reporting skills.<br>Project-based learning and feedback on technical assignments.<br>Experience collaborating in a remote working environment.<br><br>Internship Details<br><br>Work Mode: Online / Work From Home<br><br>Duration: 36 Months<br><br>Location: Pune, Maharashtra<br><br>Company: WeIntern Pvt. Ltd.<br><br>Office Address: B Wing, 3rd Floor, Office No. 5, City Vista, Fountain Road, Kharadi, Pune, Maharashtra.<br><br>Learn. Build. Experience. Grow.<br><br>Compensation: 10,000.00 - 20,000.00 per month<br><br>Work Location: In person .</span></div><div jsname="G7vtgf" class="TOQyFc Uzkg7d MmMIvd brKmxb" aria-controls="tsuid_INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ_254" role="button" tabindex="0" jsaction="EMtXr" data-l="" data-hveid="CCoQQQ" data-ved="2ahUKEwig67LAnIyYAxUqyDgGHSuUJw8Ql5ACegQIKhBB"><hr class="Bi9oQd" aria-hidden="true"><div class="Wjtive btku5b rXoM2c sjVJQd"><div class="niO4u VDgVie SlP8xc"><span class="cHaqb"><span class="PBBEhf">Show full description</span></span><span class="T2xY9b w2fKdd z1asCe" aria-hidden="true" style="height:18px;line-height:18px;width:18px"><svg focusable="false" aria