)\n\nCompany: Important Group\nJob Location: Pune, Maharashtra, India\nEmployment Type: Full-time\nExperience Required: 8+ years\n\nAbout the Role\n\nSenior Data Scientist  AI / ML (Telecom Domain Preferred)\u003c\\/b\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\nROLE OVERVIEW\u003c\\/b\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\nWe are seeking a Senior Data Scientist who can own enterprise AI engagements end -to -end - from problem framing and data understanding through model development, deployment and continuous optimization.\n\nQualifications\n\nThis role requires strong technical depth in AI/ML and data science, combined with the ability to engage directly with clients and guide teams to deliver production -grade AI solutions. Prior experience or strong working knowledge of Telecom technology and data environments is a significant advantage.\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\nKEY RESPONSIBILITIES\u003c\\/b\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Translate complex business requirements into well -scoped, testable AI/ML problem statements\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Lead exploratory data analysis, feature engineering and data quality assessment across structured and unstructured data\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Design and deliver predictive, prescriptive and generative AI solutions aligned to business outcomes\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Select modelling approaches considering interpretability, stability and operational constraints\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Collaborate with data engineering teams to ensure consistency between training and inference pipelines\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Ensure AI solutions are production -ready, explainable and scalable\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Support client workshops, discovery sessions and solution walkthroughs\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Provide technical guidance and design oversight to data scientists and ML engineers\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\u003c\\/span\u003e\n\nRequirements\u003c\\/h3\u003e\n\nTECHNICAL EXPERTISE\n\n\u003c\\/b\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Solid foundation in statistics, machine learning and applied data science\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Experience with supervised, unsupervised, semi -supervised and ensemble learning techniques\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Hands -on expertise in time -series modeling, forecasting and sequence -based data\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Experience with generative AI and LLM -based systems, including retrieval -augmented generation (RAG)\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Understanding of evaluation strategies, biasvariance trade -offs, feature leakage and model generalization\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Familiarity with model lifecycle management, data drift and concept drift\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\nTOOLS \u0026 PLATFORMS\u003c\\/b\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Python and the modern data science ecosystem\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n ML frameworks such as TensorFlow, PyTorch and Scikit -learn\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n LLM and generative AI frameworks and orchestration tools\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Cloud platforms and contemporary data platforms\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Open Source and Propriety tooling\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Ability to evaluate and recommend tools and architectures based on enterprise context\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\nDOMAIN KNOWLEDGE (PREFERRED)\u003c\\/b\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Experience or strong familiarity with Telecom technology and data domains\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Exposure to BSS/OSS systems, roaming technology, charging, billing, customer analytics or network performance data\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Ability to incorporate domain constraints into AI solution design and evaluation\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\nQUALIFICATIONS\u003c\\/b\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n 8+ years of experience in Data Science, AI/ML or advanced analytics roles\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Proven delivery of real -world, production -grade AI solutions\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Comfortable operating in client -facing, consultative environments\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\n Strong communication skills and system -level thinking\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\nROLE CHARACTERISTICS\u003c\\/b\u003e\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\n\nThis role sits at the intersection of business understanding, deep technical expertise and delivery accountability. It is not a research -only or back -office position; it requires ownership, judgment and the ability to operate effectively across abstraction levels  from data and models to systems and business outcomes.\n\n\u003c\\/div\u003e\u003c\\/span\u003e .","Senior Data Scientist  AI / ML (Pune)",null,null,0,[["organization","Important Group"],["publisher_name","Shine"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2bf2e67461101:0x828d43bf9d9ee343"],["cluster_id","0xc0e8459ed52e989e"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ66":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[15111100,0.93538785,5]]],"INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ79":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003d1rD9NKtlLeAcJqaKAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xWNMQrCQBAAsc0TrLawUJGcCDYKgiCEgAEhDwibY8mdJLfH7QZS-gef4M98iaaZaobJPovsUlPwnOCGilBbT0G9KMC1BAPVHdaPMdAGvq83PLkFIUzWAQcomLuelmenGuVkjEifd6Ko3uaWB8OBWp7MP5IZjThMFHtUag7H_ZTH0G1X5RA5KQaFIvEYwQeYfzuo8K-jOE34Azfd7IWmAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAow2E6C0a8vWvHhhp08QfogCnE0s-WUYx1P2hTRzH9Co0w\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djobs\u0026htidocid\u003d1rD9NKtlLeAcJqaKAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026htiq\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs",null,null,"Senior Data Scientist  AI / ML (Pune)",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,["H4sIAAAAAAAA_xWNMQrCQBAAsc0TrLawUJGcCDYKgiCEgAEhDwibY8mdJLfH7QZS-gef4M98ia