d generating meaningful insights.\n\nRoles and Responsibilities\n\n Collect, clean, transform, and analyze structured datasets.\n Perform exploratory data analysis (EDA) to identify trends and patterns.\n Use Python libraries such as Pandas, NumPy, and Matplotlib for data analysis and visualization.\n Write SQL queries to retrieve, filter, and manipulate data.\n Prepare reports, dashboards, and visualizations to communicate findings.\n Apply basic statistical techniques to support data-driven decisions.\n Assist in developing predictive models and data science solutions.\n Identify data quality issues and recommend improvements.\n Maintain documentation of analysis, methodologies, and project results.\n\nEligibility Criteria\n\n Students, freshers, and candidates interested in Data Science may apply.\n Basic knowledge of Python programming.\n Familiarity with Pandas, NumPy, and data visualization is preferred.\n Basic understanding of statistics and probability.\n Knowledge of SQL and database concepts is an advantage.\n Familiarity with Excel, Power BI, Tableau, or Machine Learning is desirable.\n Valuable analytical, logical reasoning, and problem-solving skills.\n Willingness to learn recent tools and complete assigned projects.\n\nWhat You Will Gain\n\n Practical experience in data analysis and exploratory data analysis.\n Exposure to real-world datasets and data science workflows.\n Experience with Python, SQL, and visualization tools.\n Prospects to develop analytical and reporting skills.\n Project-based learning and feedback on technical assignments.\n Experience collaborating in a remote working environment.\n\nInternship Details\n\nWork Mode: Online / Work From Home\n\nDuration: 36 Months\n\nLocation: Pune, Maharashtra\n\nCompany: WeIntern Pvt. Ltd.\n\nOffice Address: B Wing, 3rd Floor, Office No. 5, City Vista, Fountain Road, Kharadi, Pune, Maharashtra.\n\nLearn. Build. Experience. Grow.\n\nCompensation: 10,000.00 - 20,000.00 per month\n\nWork Location: In person .","Data Science Intern Pune (India)",null,null,0,[["organization","WeIntern"],["publisher_name","Shine"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2bf2e67461101:0x828d43bf9d9ee343"],["cluster_id","0x00363a35f80cd53a"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ75":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[15111100,0.20805712,5]]],"INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ87":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003dUn76zo2y9MQYsO8NAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_y2NMQrCQBAAsc0TBGFLFcmJYGFsBUkhCBaWYXMuuZO4G25XSOkfLPyfLzGizVQzTPYaZZsdGsLJR2JPULJRYjjemWBa8iXiDN6PJ1ylBiVMPoAw7EWalsbbYNZp4ZxqmzdqaNHnXm5OmGrp3RDpF5UGTNS1aFSt1ss-77iZT870n8XfbwEHHDzUYAk_001pEZoAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAoz6JleYm8l08sDN1icrEC79anvn6sn-WOICsa_FYXctSA\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djobs\u0026htidocid\u003dUn76zo2y9MQYsO8NAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026htiq\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs",null,null,"Data Science Intern Pune (India)",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,["H4sIAAAAAAAA_y2NMQrCQBAAsc0TBGFLFcmJYGFsBUkhCBaWYXMuuZO4G25XSOkfLPyfLzGizVQzTPYaZZsdGsLJR2JPULJRYjjemWBa8iXiDN6PJ1ylBiVMPoAw7EWalsbbYNZp4ZxqmzdqaNHnXm5OmGrp3RDpF5UGTNS1aFSt1ss-77iZT870n8XfbwEHHDzUYAk_001pEZoAAAA","v1_Ac3VAoz6JleYm8l08sDN1icrEC79anvn6sn-WOICsa_FYXctSA"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0]],"INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ106":["https://www.shine.com/jobs/data-science-intern-pune-india/weintern/20050953?utm_campaign\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\u0026utm_source\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\u0026utm_medium\u003dorganic",null,"Shine","Un76zo2y9MQYsO