htra, India\nEmployment Type: Full-time\nExperience Required: 3+ years\n\nAbout Atos Group\n\nAtos Group is a global leader in digital transformation with c. 67,000 employees and annual revenue of c. 10 billion, operating in 61 countries under two brands  Atos for services and Eviden for products. European number one in cybersecurity, cloud and high performance computing, Atos Group is committed to a secure and decarbonized future and provides tailored AI-powered, end-to-end solutions for all industries. Atos Group is the brand under which Atos SE (Societas Europaea) operates. Atos SE is listed on Euronext Paris.\n\nThe purpose of Atos Group is to help design the future of the information space. Its expertise and services support the development of knowledge, education and research in a multicultural approach and contribute to the development of scientific and technological excellence. Across the world, the Group enables its customers and employees, and members of societies at large to live, work and develop sustainably, in a safe and secure information space.\n\nHiring for DataScientist Role\n\nRole Overview:\n\nWere seeking a highly skilled and self-directed Senior Data Scientist to lead complex analytics initiatives across IT operations, ITSM platforms, and telemetry systems. This role demands deep technical expertise, strategic thinking, and the ability to translate raw data into actionable insights that drive operational efficiency, user satisfaction, and business value.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n\n Lead end-to-end data science projects focused on IT operations, incident management, and experience optimization.\n Analyze structured and unstructured data from ITSM systems (e.g., ServiceNow), endpoint telemetry platforms (e.g., Nexthink, Intune), and infrastructure monitoring tools.\n Develop predictive models for incident forecasting, root cause analysis, and proactive remediation.\n Design anomaly detection algorithms to identify performance degradation, user friction, or compliance risks.\n Build dashboards and visualizations to communicate insights to technical and executive stakeholders.\n Collaborate with IT architects, service owners, and automation teams to embed intelligence into operational workflows.\n Evaluate data quality, lineage, and governance across diverse IT data sources.\n Stay current with emerging trends in AIOps, DEX, and IT analytics.\n\nRequired Skills \u0026 Experience:\n\n Overall 15+ years of experience in IT \u0026 Software, 8+ years of experience in data science, with at least 3 years focused on IT operations or enterprise IT analytics.\n Proficiency in Python, SQL, and data science libraries (e.g., scikit-learn, pandas, TensorFlow).\n Strong understanding of ITSM data structures, incident lifecycle, and operational KPIs.\n Experience with telemetry platforms (e.g., Nexthink, SysTrack, Intune, SCCM) and endpoint data.\n Familiarity with cloud infrastructure metrics (Azure, AWS, GCP) and log analytics.\n Expertise in statistical modeling, machine learning, and time-series analysis.\n Ability to work independently and manage multiple complex projects simultaneously.\n Expertise in using compute and AI resources on MS Azure.\n Expertise in using statistical un-supervised models, supervised models, LLMs and SLMs\n Excellent communication skills for cross-functional collaboration and executive reporting.\n\nPreferred Qualifications:\n\n Experience in AIOps, DEX, or EUC analytics domains.\n Knowledge of ServiceNow, performance analytics, and integration workflows.\n Exposure to MLOps frameworks and model deployment in enterprise environments.\n Advanced degree in Computer Science, Statistics, or a related field.\n\nHere at Atos, diversity and inclusion are embedded in our DNA. Read more about our commitment to a fair work environment for all.\n\nAtos is a recognized leader in its industry across Environment, Social and Governance (ESG) criteria. Find out more on our CSR commitment.\n\nChoose your future. Choose Atos. .","Senior Data Scientist - IT Operations \u0026 Analytics",null,null,0,[["organization","Atos"],["organization_mid","/m/03mndf"],["publisher_name","Shine"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2bf2e67461101:0x828d43bf9d9ee343"],["cluster_id","0xf42f5338bfa79bb7"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ53":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[15111100,0.23361816,5]]],"INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ70":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003d6e7tqGpESzOntFGiAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xXLMQrCQBBAUWxzA62mshDNimCjVUAQBVGIfZgsQ3YlzoSdEWLnHbyCJ_MkxuZX_2WfUXYsiaMk2KEhlD4SW1SDBRyucO4ooUVhhSkUjO3Tolf4vt5wkxqUMPkAwrAXaVqabINZpxvnVNu8URusz73cnTDV0rsB6T-VBkzUtWhUrdbLPu-4mY0LE4XIcHkwzeGEw4MaLOEPqoOe3qcAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAoz2AibZv3NID-Bn2LQ4ZMBcDZwscNzwRTsC46ime34_fw\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djobs\u0026htidocid\u003d6e7tqGpESzOntFGiAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026htiq\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+4+years+of+experience+jobs",null,null,"Senior Data Scientist - IT Operations \u0026 Analytics",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,["H4sIAAAAAAAA_xXLMQrCQBBAUWxzA62mshDNimCjVUAQBVGIfZgsQ3YlzoSdEWLnHbyCJ_MkxuZX_2WfUXYsiaMk2KEhlD4SW1SDBRyucO4ooUVhhSkUjO3Tolf4vt5wkxqUMPkAwrAXaVqabINZpxvnVNu8URusz73cnTDV0rsB6T-VBkzUtWhUrdbLPu-4mY0LE4XIcHkwzeGEw4MaLOEPqoOe3qcAAAA","v1_Ac3VAoz2AibZv3NID-Bn2LQ4ZMBcDZwscNzwRTsC46ime34_fw"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0]],"INP6aqDbJqqQ4-EPq6ieeQ82":["https://www.shine.com/jobs/senior-data-scientist-it-operations-analytics/atos/19937562?utm_campa